## Also

- Commit generated `plugins/fulcrum/main.js`, `plugins/fulcrum/styles.css`, and `plugins/fulcrum/src/generated/pluginStyles.ts` when they change.
- If the vault path is missing (cloud agent with no vault), still run `npm run build -w obsidian-plugin-fulcrum` and say that install was skipped. Never skip the production build.
- Swift Fulcrum Bridge changes are separate: `plugins/fulcrum-bridge/build.sh` / `install-daemon.sh` on macOS. Still build/install the Obsidian plugin.
